  "question": {
    "text": "Cards are drawn one by one at random from a well shuffled pack of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn></math> cards until <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> aces are obtained for the first time. The probability that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math> draws are required for this is",
    "image": null
  },
